{"overview":"سال ۲۰۲۰ است و میزوهو بدترین هفدهمین تولد را تجربه می‌کند؛ والدینش تولد او را فراموش کرده‌اند، هنوز نمی‌تواند به ارشد مورد علاقه‌اش نزدیک شود و تمام سفرهای مدرسه و مسابقات به‌دلیل بیماری جدیدی که در حال گسترش است لغو شده‌اند. او فکر می‌کند هرگز جوانی که همیشه آرزو داشته است را نخواهد داشت… تا این که دوست دوران کودکی‌اش، کیزوکی، ناگهان از او دعوت می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"It’s the year 2020, and Mizuho is having the worst 17th birthday ever. Her parents forgot it’s her birthday, she still can’t seem to get close to the senior she likes, and all her school trips and tournaments are canceled thanks to a new disease going around. She’s convinced she’ll never have the kind of youth she’s always dreamt of…until her childhood friend, Kizuki, suddenly asks her out.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2025,"poster":"/pEo0CsDfaEPZqiQYe9Hcc4BbErQ.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"新福桜","role":"Mizuho Nishino (voice)","photo":"/34AAdfva8gyJe8daFlWfiwl6EfI.jpg","en":"Sakura Shinfuku"},{"name":"浦和希","role":"Kizuki Hazawa (voice)","photo":"/7eUgENWREmWSMnLPUFCQhvUSpdI.jpg","en":"Kazuki Ura"},{"name":"吉高志音","role":"Shin Kashiwagi (voice)","photo":"/8W57e2UE0g8aTN5SeqschB7w8Fb.jpg","en":"Sion Yoshitaka"},{"name":"千葉翔也","role":"Airu Izumi (voice)","photo":"/pF2urY77wuCYd9Fxh7dTirFYKSF.jpg","en":"Shoya Chiba"},{"name":"猪股慧士","role":"Shugo Hoshikawa (voice)","photo":"/hAoRLGuberMhFY1f6ULJGiIu1e.jpg","en":"Satoshi Inomata"},{"name":"上村祐翔","role":"Ryosuke Saito (voice)","photo":"/boQMSI9WA5x2LYDEsiq0udeKMNe.jpg","en":"Yuto Uemura"},{"name":"آزوزا تادوکورو","role":"Chika Kurashiki (voice)","photo":"/kYQX26kSAUdPn5tDgMzdbjDSZdO.jpg","en":"Azusa Tadokoro"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Togo Hoshikawa (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"名塚佳織","role":"Manami Shiraishi (voice)","photo":"/cIMS99s6jpgGBbMnih8gx9hLPFi.jpg","en":